@startuml sequence-upsell
' Smart upsell suggestions (menu option 11).
title Smart upsell sequence (menu option 11)

skinparam shadowing false
autonumber

actor User
participant CliApp
participant UpsellAdvisor
participant PricingEngine
participant "Repository<DiscountRule>" as Rules
participant UpsellPrinter

User -> CliApp : 11 (Smart upsell suggestions)
CliApp -> UpsellAdvisor : suggest(ctx, rules, policy(), catalog)
activate UpsellAdvisor
UpsellAdvisor -> PricingEngine ** : PricingEngine(resolver, guards())
UpsellAdvisor -> PricingEngine : price(current cart)
PricingEngine --> UpsellAdvisor : now

loop each catalog product P
  UpsellAdvisor -> UpsellAdvisor : bigger = cart + 1 x P\nalone = only 1 x P
  UpsellAdvisor -> PricingEngine : price(bigger)
  PricingEngine --> UpsellAdvisor : withIt
  UpsellAdvisor -> PricingEngine : price(alone)
  PricingEngine --> UpsellAdvisor : byItself
  UpsellAdvisor -> UpsellAdvisor : extraCost = withIt - now\nbonus = byItself - extraCost
  alt bonus > 0
    UpsellAdvisor -> UpsellAdvisor : unlocked = offers in withIt\nbut not in now or byItself
  else
    UpsellAdvisor -> UpsellAdvisor : skip P
  end
end
note over UpsellAdvisor, PricingEngine
  Only prices are compared: no rule types or thresholds
  are inspected, so every current and future offer,
  decorator and text rule is understood (Open/Closed).
  Nothing is recorded: coupon usage stays unchanged.
end note

UpsellAdvisor -> UpsellAdvisor : sort by bonus, keep top 3
UpsellAdvisor --> CliApp : vector<UpsellSuggestion>
deactivate UpsellAdvisor
CliApp -> UpsellPrinter : print(out, suggestions, policy name)
UpsellPrinter --> User : "Add 1 x Cotton Kurta ... you save ₹1,064 extra"
@enduml
